{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Getting started"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the package, give the wallet its keys, its storage and a Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provider, and create it at launch."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/gettingstarted"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" needs four things from your app: its configuration, a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","isActive":true},{"text":" for its keys, a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for what it holds, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" that attests it to issuers. The package has standard","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stores for the first two; the Wallet Provider is your backend."}]},{"anchor":"Add-the-package","type":"heading","text":"Add the package","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add OID4VCWallet to your app with Swift Package Manager, from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift"},{"type":"text","text":", at the release"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose documentation you’re reading. In "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift\", from: \"<version>\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The package links a binary framework, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"type":"text","text":", which SwiftPM checks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"against the checksum in the package’s manifest.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Register-the-wallet","type":"heading","text":"Register the wallet","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Issuers’ Authorization Servers know the wallet as an OAuth client: a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"client ID, and a redirect URI the app opens when the holder returns from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the issuer’s pages. Register a private-use URI scheme for it, in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app’s Info.plist ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CFBundleURLTypes"},{"type":"text","text":"), and pass the URL the app receives"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the issuance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet trusts only what chains to the roots you give it, as PEM"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"certificates: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"issuerRoots"},{"type":"text","text":" for credentials, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verifierRoots"},{"type":"text","text":" for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Verifiers it answers. A Credential Offer’s issuer isn’t trusted just"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"because it sent the offer."}]},{"anchor":"Provide-the-keys-and-the-storage","type":"heading","text":"Provide the keys and the storage","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps every key in the Secure Enclave. A holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key — the one a credential is bound to — signs only when presenting, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by default asks for Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode first: add an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" to the app’s Info.plist, or iOS asks for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passcode instead."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps each credential as a file with complete"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data protection, out of backups: a credential is useless without its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder key, which can’t leave this device. An app with a document"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provider extension keeps both in places the extension can read too; see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup"},{"type":"text","text":". The app and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extension then share one store: a store of your own implements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/compareAndSwap(id:expected:record:)"},{"type":"text","text":" atomically"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"across both processes, as "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" does with a file"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lock."}]},{"anchor":"Implement-the-Wallet-Provider","type":"heading","text":"Implement the Wallet Provider","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Issuers following HAIP accept only a wallet its Wallet Provider has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attested: a Wallet Attestation for the wallet’s instance key, and a Key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Attestation for the keys a credential will be bound to. Your backend"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issues them; the app passes the keys and returns its answers. A real"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Wallet Provider attests only after checking App Attest evidence that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it’s talking to your genuine app."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Asks the app's backend for attestations. The keys are public JWKs,","\/\/\/ as JSON; the answers are compact JWTs.","struct BackendWalletProvider: WalletProvider {","    let backend: URL","","    func walletAttestation(clientID: String, instanceKey: Data) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"wallet-attestation\", [","            \"client_id\": clientID,","            \"instance_key\": try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: instanceKey),","        ])","    }","","    func keyAttestation(keys: [Data], nonce: String) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"key-attestation\", [","            \"keys\": try keys.map { try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: $0) },","            \"nonce\": nonce,","        ])","    }","","    private func post(_ path: String, _ body: [String: Any]) async throws -> String {","        var request = URLRequest(url: backend.appending(path: path))","        request.httpMethod = \"POST\"","        request.setValue(\"application\/json\", forHTTPHeaderField: \"Content-Type\")","        request.httpBody = try JSONSerialization.data(withJSONObject: body)","        let (data, response) = try await URLSession.shared.data(for: request)","        guard (response as? HTTPURLResponse)?.statusCode == 200 else { throw URLError(.badServerResponse) }","        return String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError"},{"type":"text","text":" the provider throws reaches the wallet as a retryable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network"},{"type":"text","text":" error; any other is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Create-the-wallet","type":"heading","text":"Create the wallet","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create one "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" when the app starts, and keep it. Creating it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes no network requests. At launch, before anything else, sweep the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Keychain of keys no credential uses: an issuance the app quit in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"middle of leaves its keys behind. Each trust role whose roots you set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"needs a revocation choice: checked against the CRLs your app fetches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/revocation"},{"type":"text","text":"), or declined"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/noRevocationCheck"},{"type":"text","text":"); see "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ The app's wallet, created once at launch.","@MainActor","final class AppWallet {","    let wallet: Wallet","    private let keys: KeychainKeyStore","","    init(clientID: String, redirectURI: String, issuerRoots: String, verifierRoots: String, crls: String, provider: URL) throws {","        let configuration = WalletConfiguration(","            clientID: clientID,","            redirectURI: redirectURI,","            issuerRoots: issuerRoots,","            verifierRoots: verifierRoots,","            crls: crls,","            revocation: [.issuer, .status, .verifier])","        keys = KeychainKeyStore()","        wallet = try Wallet(","            configuration: configuration,","            keyStore: keys,","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.standard(),","            provider: BackendWalletProvider(backend: provider))","    }","","    \/\/\/ Run once at launch, before any issuance.","    func start() async throws {","        try await wallet.sweepOrphanedKeys(in: keys)","    }","}"]},{"anchor":"Ship-the-release-build","type":"heading","text":"Ship the release build","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The package links the release build of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"type":"text","text":". OID4VCgo’s own tests"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use a test build with an in-process issuer and Verifier that a shipped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app must never have; "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild"},{"type":"text","text":" says which one an app has,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so it can refuse to run on the test build."}]},{"anchor":"Next-steps","type":"heading","text":"Next steps","level":3},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]}]}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/OID4VC/isTestBuild":{"abstract":[{"text":"Whether the linked framework is the test build, carrying an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in-process test issuer and Verifier (","type":"text"},{"code":"-tags mobiletest","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"): an app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"should refuse to run on it.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","title":"isTestBuild","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/oid4vc\/istestbuild","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isTestBuild","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential store and Wallet Provider."}],"title":"Wallet","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Wallet"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Wallet"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingToSafari":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a web page’s request for an mdoc over the Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, as an iOS document provider."}],"title":"Presenting to Safari","role":"article","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingtosafari","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore/inAppGroup(_:options:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A store in the app group "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"identifier"},{"type":"text","text":"’s container"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(Library\/Application Support\/credentials there), which the app and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its extensions listing the group in their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.security.application-groups"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement share."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","title":"inAppGroup(_:options:)","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore\/inappgroup(_:options:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"inAppGroup"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"options"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Options","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC7OptionsV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FileCredentialStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A credential store of files: one per credential record, in a directory"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the app’s (Application Support, by default). Records are written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the given file protection — complete by default: readable only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while the device is unlocked — and kept out of backups by default,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"since a credential is useless without its holder key, which is in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this device’s Secure Enclave and can’t be restored elsewhere."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"FileCredentialStore"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","title":"FileCredentialStore","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FileCredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/platform":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"platform","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletError","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Code","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A key store, credential store or Wallet Provider call failed; its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"message follows."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","title":"platform","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/platform"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth."}],"title":"OID4VCWallet","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/network":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/network","abstract":[{"text":"A request couldn’t be made, got no answer, or timed out. Retryable.","type":"text"}],"title":"network","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"network","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","text":"WalletError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","text":"Code","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/noRevocationCheck":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The trust roles that decline checking revocation, as an explicit","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"choice: only where something else stands in for it, such as"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"certificates too short-lived to be worth revoking. A role can’t be"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in both this and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revocation"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/noRevocationCheck","title":"noRevocationCheck","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"noRevocationCheck","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"RevocationRole","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19WalletConfigurationV14RevocationRoleO"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/norevocationcheck","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingFromALink":{"type":"topic","role":"article","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a Verifier’s OpenID4VP request: show who is asking and what,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"let the holder choose, and present exactly that."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","title":"Presenting from a link","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingfromalink"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/IntegrationChecklist":{"type":"topi