xt":"are compact JWTs. A real one attests only after checking platform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"evidence (App Attest) that it’s talking to the genuine app.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","title":"WalletProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletprovider"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"abstract":[{"text":"The wallet’s keys, in the Secure Enclave and the Keychain: P-256 keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"whose private halves never leave the Security framework. Each key’s"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Options.tagPrefix"},{"type":"text","text":"), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","title":"KeychainKeyStore","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialStore":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s credentials, as opaque records kept by ID under the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform’s data protection. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is the standard one."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4v